WEBVTT

00:09:29.125 --> 00:09:31.393
it's another 40 dollars.

00:09:31.417 --> 00:09:33.559
But today is the time to do it.

00:09:33.583 --> 00:09:37.726
Because she is truly
the biggest asset we have.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:41.101
I am Safeena Husain, and I educate girls.

00:09:41.125 --> 00:09:42.393
Thank you.

00:09:42.417 --> 00:09:45.958
(Applause)